                                "sense_id": "5a717b88-97d6-33d0-ab56-18d84ac61a39",
                                "text": "While the vast majority of guests are polite, pleasant, and appreciative of the importance of the roomkeeper's work, there are others, on occasion, who are silly, rude, overbearing, intoxicated, menacing, or annoying."
